"received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201571770", "author": {"steamid": "76561198331451689", "personaname": "Bearframe", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198331451689/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 53313, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1319, "playtime_at_review": 1542, "last_played": 1791486379, "avatar": "279b52809ca09e1fa3bb40339d7fd1a4bec31037"}, "language": "english", "review": "Don't buy it. They literally copy/pasted SE 5. This should have been a DLC but was promoted as a new game. I enjoyed the survival mode option on SE 5 and checked out this one. Well, Pest Control, Tides of War, and Unwanted Guests were brought over from SE 5 and they only used a few maps from the new game. Are you serious? It's not even a new game. The take downs are the same as SE 5, the x-ray shots are the same as SE 5, and the game-play is identical (copy/paste). Not that I'm looking for crazy differences or massive operating overhauls but this just seems like a lazy way to make money off suckers... like me.\nI'm a huge Battlefield fan and appreciated all of their new iterations. Even BF4 was very similar to BF3 and imported some of those maps over. It still quickly became my favorite BF. \nA new SE game would have unique take-downs based on character, take down items like a mace or trench knife, more x-ray options (an ankle mobility kill, a neck shot that hit either trachea shot vs artery and the reaction of the victim, knee caps, shoulder disable, etc). \nI hate that nothing was changed from SE 5 and I don't recommend purchasing this game. Oh yeah, the revolver is not a 1 shot kill anymore and takes way longer to load :(", "timestamp_created": 1754489488, "timestamp_updated": 1754489488, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.496021240949630737", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201536266", "author": {"steamid": "76561198967698570", "personaname": "ŁysySkurwiel69", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198967698570/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 74, "playtime_forever": 1262, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 242, "last_played": 1772217821, "avatar": "98af036b4358c14d2e8838eb2f275dd2a980089d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Neutral review would be perfect: it's basically SE 5 DLC pack released as standalone game with handful of bugs, graphical downgrade and protagonist looking like some strange cartoon character after year spent in russia. Still almost the same amount of fun as in previous release.", "timestamp_created": 1754436581, "timestamp_updated": 1754436581, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.497925341129302979", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201510164", "author": {"steamid": "76561199230370676", "personaname": "cabdriver1", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199230370676/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2200, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1406, "last_played": 1754692324, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": " Great Play.", "timestamp_created": 1754408653, "timestamp_updated": 1754408653, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": 